# The build context is an allowlist: nothing enters the image but the Go
# source and module files the build needs. A developer's .env, a catalog
# with inline credentials, agent settings, keys, the git history and built
# artefacts all stay out of the builder and its cache (e2e/context_test.go
# checks this with secret-shaped fixtures; the build stage checks it again).
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!main.go
!internal/**/*.go
!e2e/go.mod
!e2e/fakemcp/*.go
!e2e/runner/*.go
